msgid ""
"Once detached, the status of the device is changed to \"Detached\" (see "
"screenshot below) and the device is available for consumption by VMs "
"running on this host."
msgstr ""
"Once detached, el estado del device es cambiado a \"Detached\" (ver "
"screenshot a continuación) y el device está disponible para consumption "
"por VMs ejecutando en este host."

